<BaseLayout
  title="NITP: Teaching LLMs to Model Meaning, Not Just Predict Tokens | AI/ML Deep Dives"
  description="Standard NTP leaves hidden states free to collapse into an anisotropic cone — NITP fixes this with a single auxiliary loss that predicts the shallow-layer representation of the next token, yielding +5.7% on MMLU-Pro at 9B scale."
