<span class="cs-line hl-g"><span class="cmt"># │ BBH          │ 28.07  │ 28.67  │ +0.60 pp</span></span>
<span class="cs-line hl-g"><span class="cmt"># │ GSM8k        │ 30.09  │ 32.52  │ +2.43 pp</span></span>
<span class="cs-line hl-g"><span class="cmt"># │ LCBench      │  6.95  │  8.00  │ +1.05 pp</span></span>
