<span class="cs-line cmt">#   1.9B MoE: +0.81 avg  |  3B MoE: +2.12 avg</span>
<span class="cs-line cmt">#   9B MoE:  +2.67 avg  ← larger models benefit more</span>
      </pre>
    </div>

